    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Frequency and progress",
     "texto": [
      "**her zaman** = always; **çoğu zaman** = most of the time; **hiçbir zaman** = never.",
      "To talk about an action in progress, use the present continuous you already know: **bu hafta çok çalışıyorum** = this week I'm working a lot.",
      "**ama** links two opposing ideas: «but»."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
  },
